    </div>

              <div class="grid-row grid-gap">
      <div class="usa-layout-docs__main desktop:grid-col-fill">
            <div id="block-mainpagecontent" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      
      
  
    
  
<div class="node-basic-page">
      <section>
        <div  class="fns-page-header node-page-header"
    >
    <div class="hero-image-container page-hero-image ">
        <div class="grid-container page-header-content page-header-content">
            <div class="title-box page-header-title-box">
                <h1 class="page-header-title">
<span>Report Series - Characteristics of SNAP Households</span>
</h1>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
                    <div class="page_breadcrumb-container">
            <div class="grid-container">
                <div id="block-fns-uswds-breadcrumbs" class="block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block">
  
    
      <div class="page_breadcrumb">
  <nav role="navigation" aria-labelledby="system-breadcrumb">
    <h2 id="system-breadcrumb" class="usa-sr-only">Breadcrumb</h2>
    <ol class="usa-breadcrumb__list">
              <li class="usa-breadcrumb__list-item">
                      <a href="/" class="usa-breadcrumb__link">Home</a>
                  </li>
              <li class="usa-breadcrumb__list-item">
                      <a href="/research" class="usa-breadcrumb__link">Research &amp; Analysis</a>
                  </li>
          </ol>
  </nav>
</div>

  </div>

                            </div>
        </div>
        </section>
    <article  class="grid-container fns-node-page__container">
    <div class="basic-page-content">
    
                  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--wysiwyg paragraph--view-mode--default grid-container" style="background-color: #ffffff;" >
          <div class="wysiwyg-container">


            <div class="field field--name-field-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h2>Series Overview</h2><div class="grid-row"><div class="tablet:grid-col-6"><p>The <a href="/snap/supplemental-nutrition-assistance-program" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="6d4b23b9-31b0-4bd8-9e30-8a152a83998d" data-entity-substitution="canonical">Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program</a> (SNAP) provides nutrition assistance to eligible, low-income individuals and households. SNAP is the largest domestic nutrition assistance program we administer.</p><p>We use SNAP administrative data collected for <a href="/snap/qc" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="4bd8e689-0d07-42a1-8594-c24dc30c1717" data-entity-substitution="canonical">quality control</a> to publish reports detailing the characteristics and economic circumstances of SNAP households. In the list below, you can access published reports that go back to fiscal year (FY) 1997. Each report provides an overview of SNAP, a narrative description of the SNAP population, and data tables detailing characteristics at both the national and state level.</p></div><div class="tablet:grid-col-6"><div class="image300 align-center">
  
  


            <div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/media/image/snap-healthy-incentives_0.jpeg" width="5377" height="4032" alt="paper grocery bag of veggies">

</div>
      
</div>
</div></div><h2>Series Reports</h2><p>Publication date is included in parenthesis next to each FY.</p><div class="grid-row"><div class="tablet:grid-col-3"><ul><li data-list-item-id="e89f177e0e8c2a519ae8b9c7b9ba28296"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-fy24" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="3172003b-4f43-462a-be5b-0dd0aa9d41cb" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2024</a> (May 2026)</li><li data-list-item-id="e30f934cc77e8814a93e9934cf9a26355"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-fy23" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="36cd12bb-891d-4588-bd14-75fd1ec994b1" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2023</a> (April 2025)</li><li data-list-item-id="ec60bb6f49822e33373d28a52f1d3827f"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-fy22" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a1533ac4-06ea-44b0-a62a-dcb75507449f" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2022</a> (June 2024)</li><li data-list-item-id="ec16ef18f57485a59795820ab41c2d573">FY 2021 (no report)<a href="#footnote1"><sup>1</sup></a></li><li data-list-item-id="ea531bbb6e32b6f961a057fe5956149ad"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy20-early-covid19-characteristics" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="79ccd308-464d-43a0-b888-2c594049aefb" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2020</a> (June 2022)</li><li data-list-item-id="e9625a252c62e4c83f5a2b1c94efb588d"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-snap-households-fy-2019" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="9c52fa1b-f482-43b9-a365-b41104248751" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2019</a> (March 2021)</li><li data-list-item-id="e29f883274bcd1cd916b58aae14bf758c"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2018" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a0b5db27-ff34-466e-9cee-1e84a5e5dcb0" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2018</a> (November 2019)</li></ul></div><div class="tablet:grid-col-3"><ul><li data-list-item-id="e2615ff18f20d40fcaeacb4e8390f3330"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy17" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="ea942378-ec09-48f7-93d4-612f07c03c36" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2017</a> (February 2019)</li><li data-list-item-id="e30464daa121403cfe76bffd6085f3d62"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2016" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="9d3c5a32-4a6c-45f1-8ec0-1fe312060413" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2016 </a>(November 2017)</li><li data-list-item-id="e3ba5d3513f2ede37baabb7e19202d46e"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2015" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="c9dc67f6-07b6-479a-b1cb-eac0b14dfad8" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2015</a> (November 2016)</li><li data-list-item-id="e74f38bfc0386d7f493c4dfcfc9b7edd8"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2014" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="1aa1fb71-a7f8-4999-9159-caa6a328e9f2" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2014</a> (December 2015)</li><li data-list-item-id="ed2fe5f8b793eb8432d0e5c5bdc7502c9"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2013" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="58ce3275-2e7e-4d09-b24f-c4cce01f0b14" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2013</a> (December 2014)</li><li data-list-item-id="ebba78d062b2cf083d655c121556976bf"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2012" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="65819835-1936-4486-8333-0c2a8abc01cb" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2012</a> (February 2014)</li><li data-list-item-id="ebae3ac6599a774d5d28680efb1bf7ce5"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2011" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="6ca29eee-51d2-48ab-b033-d527abadab21" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2011</a> (November 2012)</li></ul></div><div class="tablet:grid-col-3"><ul><li data-list-item-id="e40bc7471e7b62c10088dfdbcec4b6535"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2010" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="737ff6d3-4784-492e-a928-577e7b9a5c46" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2010</a> (September 2011)</li><li data-list-item-id="eaad0ed42cbcc6ed0946919430a5764c9"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2009" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="4c2ed55c-eeb6-4e36-8e01-2de9511df7ea" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2009</a> (October 2010)</li><li data-list-item-id="eff0cc1a2bb44c9f302da44a67b150ad2"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2008" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="5f43050f-5059-4541-a12c-6c0b42231e01" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2008</a> (September 2009)</li><li data-list-item-id="e5a6fdbcc0b359262562fd10384a5a920"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2007" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="6e15ede2-ee77-4651-89c2-e28ee3f3c0d6" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2007</a> (September 2008)</li><li data-list-item-id="eae548541583b3d734733b6739ae511a4"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2006" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="b6cbe442-afb8-4668-bc86-9490a7f33e76" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2006</a> (September 2007)</li><li data-list-item-id="e1c1c2cde52299e913ff0b4c3c3d7d658"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-food-stamp-households-fy-2005" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="a5c9f72d-9a60-4744-b9e0-5d397bea3f42" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2005</a> (September 2006)</li><li data-list-item-id="e83656ba3a5b31bc475a6294990a5c204"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2004" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="24c7b66f-e102-465d-842d-9d68d3e7e04b" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2004</a> (September 2005)</li></ul></div><div class="tablet:grid-col-3"><ul><li data-list-item-id="e8fef2d61569825d1e499c4b0ce7af663"><a href="/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2003" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="26c42a4e-c670-4eb5-8fc0-b68f54d0eb38" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2003</a> (November 2004)</li><li data-list-item-id="e942578d32d00c4d2f1c108c231a1fbf6"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-2002" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="2650cb8c-b1e2-4003-827d-b8f25ecf71a1" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2002</a> (December 2003)</li><li data-list-item-id="ec96221707756168f7c418a25f2e139d6"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-food-stamp-households-fiy-2001" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="eada130c-b415-4c8f-a3d5-814fe9009ea9" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2001</a> (January 2003)</li><li data-list-item-id="e3215b4a3bdc474364050e12f60f764c4"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-household-fy-2000" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="516f4b9d-0872-418c-98df-29300face1f4" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 2000</a> (October 2001)</li><li data-list-item-id="e541da109967680c4e8976297546c5ffd"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-1999" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="8f537122-f0b4-45df-948f-e9d79b4dfc95" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 1999</a> (December 2000)</li><li data-list-item-id="e033d39068a45d6962f94de7cd959f311"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fiy-1998" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="32fcc5e9-8c4d-4d6a-bfa9-13149053154b" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 1998</a> (February 2000)</li><li data-list-item-id="eda96bfc9848538ab44ba4f3cb4e280ad"><a href="/research/snap/characteristics-households-fy-1997" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="d970f55a-6d67-4029-b2d3-06e2a23ef9ca" data-entity-substitution="canonical">FY 1997</a> (February 1999)</li></ul></div></div><hr><p><a class="ck-anchor"><a id="footnote1"></a></a><span class="footnote"><sup>1 </sup>There was no report for FY 2021 because data were incomplete due to COVID-19 pandemic-related administrative waivers in place through most of the year.</span></p></div>
      </div>
